{"route":"/docs/4.6/content/figures/","version":"4.6","renderedVersion":"4.6","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Figures","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/site/content/docs/4.6/content/figures.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Documentation and examples for displaying related images and text with the figure component in Bootstrap."},{"id":"content--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Anytime you need to display a piece of content—like an image with an optional caption, consider using a <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code>."},{"id":"content--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Use the included <code>.figure</code> , <code>.figure-img</code> and <code>.figure-caption</code> classes to provide some baseline styles for the HTML5 <code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code> elements. Images in figures have no explicit size, so be sure to add the <code>.img-fluid</code> class to your <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> to make it responsive."},{"id":"content--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3a95f222e73a504c70de","height":147},{"id":"content--code-1","type":"code","value":"<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","language":"html"},{"id":"content--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Aligning the figure’s caption is easy with our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/text/#text-alignment\">text utilities</a>."},{"id":"content--example-2","type":"demo","key":"0a76abaa3d80b58a1eee","height":147},{"id":"content--code-2","type":"code","value":"<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <img src=\"...\" class=\"figure-img img-fluid rounded\" alt=\"...\">\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption text-right\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>","language":"html"}],"demos":[{"key":"3a95f222e73a504c70de","html":"\n<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img figure-img img-fluid rounded\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 400x300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">400x300</text></svg>\n\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"0a76abaa3d80b58a1eee","html":"\n<figure class=\"figure\">\n  <svg class=\"bd-placeholder-img figure-img img-fluid rounded\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder: 400x300\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" focusable=\"false\"><title>Placeholder</title><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#6c757d\"></rect><text x=\"50%\" y=\"50%\" fill=\"#dee2e6\" dy=\".3em\">400x300</text></svg>\n\n  <figcaption class=\"figure-caption text-right\">A caption for the above image.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Reboot","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Typography","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/typography/"},{"en":"Code","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/code/"},{"en":"Images","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/images/"},{"en":"Tables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/tables/"},{"en":"Figures","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/figures/"},{"en":"Components","href"